				<title>Critter Profile: Sparky!</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13897854/critter-profile:sparky</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 19:08:19 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Ralliston</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5986843</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>In <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5936">SCP-5936</a>, I established Daniel Asheworth lost someone important in the past. Well, this is half the answer.<br /> First of all, MASSIVE thank you to my co-author, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607812068" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>. He is very much responsible for the current state of this article and has helped me a ton in figuring this out.<br /> Secondly, another giant thanks to these folks for critting this before posting (at least from my side of the writing process o_0):<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607812068" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607812068" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span> | <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607812068" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" >Elunerazim</a></span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;trivia</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;trivia</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Sparky originally died in a car accident. That's why he lost most of his back; he was literally hit by a car in his back parts.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>~ <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage">for more garbage by me check out the ralliston coolpage funpage</a> ~</span></h3> <h3><span>~ <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uncle-nicolini-author-page">and Nico's funpage too (for very good stuff)</a> ~</span></h3> </div> <hr /> 
				 	]]>
